20261011-trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-agree-energy-ceasefire" /></entry><entry><title>India's 'cockroach' leaders vow to keep up election protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6e7fabfc60a97768b94e6d6e3b3405c4903c10eafee83a50d5235f78b9f8ba21</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T14:40:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-india-s-cockroach-leaders-vow-to-keep-up-election-protests--4609159552e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-india-s-cockroach-leaders-vow-to-keep-up-election-protests" /><summary type="html">Leaders of India's online "cockroach" movement pledged on Sunday to continue their campaign against the election commissioner, hours after they were released from detention as authorities sought to thwart a major demonstration. Our correspondent Navodita Kumari tells us more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Strike on Riyadh: What options for the Saudi-led coalition?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e412590fd19daa44771e66141f4f02c6636ef0adbf45d268ac29fc8cec737df6</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T14:39:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-strike-on-riyadh-what-options-for-the-saudi-led-coalition--82a62f40fd66.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-strike-on-riyadh-what-options-for-the-saudi-led-coalition" /><summary type="html">Saturday's attack, the deadliest on Saudi soil in more than a decade, marked a sharp escalation in the Yemen war. Riyadh backs the internationally recognised government against the Houthis, who captured swathes of the Red Sea coastline in a lightning offensive last month.

The Saudi-led coalition has vowed a firm response, but what options are on the table? We discuss this with Dr Nawaf Obaid, Senior Research Fellow in the Department of War Studies at King's College London.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump says Russia and Ukraine agree to 'energy ceasefire'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:52e1c0abd32acb5908747a8e61902f1d4b9ae987f8cfc68fb12db51b79b1052e</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:22Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T14:39:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261011-trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-agree-energy-ceasefire--acf7a15a4061.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-agree-energy-ceasefire" /><summary type="html">US President Trump said Sunday via social media platform Truth Social that Russia and Ukraine had agreed to an energy ceasefire. Neither Kyiv nor Moscow have confirmed their agreement.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Strike on Riyadh: Trump signals US could join action against Houthis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b74c5d6526142c566bdaf5fb9fc8d3cf136f493d9f0abd12ecbce252c8662ee2</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:34Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T14:34:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-strike-on-riyadh-trump-signals-us-could-join-action-against-houthis--b90e70490360.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-strike-on-riyadh-trump-signals-us-could-join-action-against-houthis" /><summary type="html">The assault on Riyadh's airport drew condemnation from the United Nations and world leaders including US President Donald Trump, who said he was considering joining Saudi strikes against the Houthis.</summary></entry><entry><title>The week in pictures: French student protests, October 7 anniversary and Adenot's return to Earth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:69c0bd48ec12a832c46ed9