n/video/20261011-spanish-pm-begins-vote-campaign-overshadowed-by-housing-protests" /><summary type="html">Spain's Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez aimed to pull off another unlikely comeback as he began campaigning on Saturday for a snap vote dominated by housing protests that have shaken the country. Our correspondent Sarah Morris tells us more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Spanish PM Sanchez kicks off election campaign amid housing crisis protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:74354974b812cff4b091ff92f3f669317b1b0136fa7cf88ce025e2fab7786f73</id><updated>2026-10-11T15:00:19Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T07:46:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-spanish-pm-sanchez-kicks-off-election-campaign-amid-housing-crisis-protests--31069b0fb951.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-spanish-pm-sanchez-kicks-off-election-campaign-amid-housing-crisis-protests" /><summary type="html">Spanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez launched his campaign for a snap November election on Saturday. The vote comes as a deepening housing crisis is driving protests and putting pressure on his left-wing coalition.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Escalating fighting in Yemen worsens food security crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7774f224ce687ed7acae55cc1f6dcc91bbba864509bc389261798f4f73b99f65</id><updated>2026-10-11T15:00:22Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T06:34:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/escalating-fighting-in-yemen-worsens-food-security-crisis--42dac36f429b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/escalating-fighting-in-yemen-worsens-food-security-crisis" /><summary type="html">Aid agencies in Yemen highlighted the growing hunger emergency sparked by renewed fighting between Houthi opposition forces and Government troops, after mobile health clinics reported that hundreds of children displaced by the violence are suffering from the most deadly form of malnutrition.</summary></entry></feed>
